          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursion travel, entrance fees \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrain \u0026amp; tram tickets included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EReturn ferry crossings from Heysham to Douglas\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPorterage included (1 piece of luggage per person)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "50442533-2545-4d1b-ba0d-c262756095a5",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe stay five nights at the 3* Ramsey Park Hotel (\u003Ca href=\u0022http://www.ramseyparkhotel.com\u0022\u003Ewww.ramseyparkhotel.com\u003C/a\u003E) at Ramsey. Offering stunning views over Mooragh Lake and the Isles Coast, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant and bar. All rooms are en suite and feature hairdryer, television, telephone, and tea \u0026amp; coffee making facilities. A set 3 course dinner without drinks is included in our hotel on the first night. A choice 3 course dinner without drinks is included in our hotel on the remaining four nights of our tour.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
