            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInsurance (including Covid cover) \u00A346\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESingle room supplement \u00A3189\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGratuities\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELunches\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDonations at any churches or cathedrals visited\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENB: If you are a member of the National Trust, or a member of the English Heritage, to qualify for the \u00A31,179 per person price, you will need to present a valid membership card on arrival at ALL attractions on the Isle of Man\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
